    "_uid": "379-root",
    "title": "Giving back: Paying it forward - for free",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Express Tribune story says that volunteerism in general has an important impact on building a sense of community and trust among people. With this spirit, scores of young people are volunteering in different departments at Aga Khan University.",
